    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present 38 Cedarbrook Way, Cherry Orchard, Dublin 10 to the market a truly exceptional two-bedroom ground floor own door apartment presented in turnkey condition throughout and lovingly maintained by its current owners. Situated within the ever-popular Cedarbrook development, this property enjoys a highly convenient location with a range of local amenities nearby including shops, cafés, supermarkets and recreational facilities. One of the standout features of this location is its outstanding connectivity, with Park West and Cherry Orchard railway station located directly across the road, providing swift and convenient access to Dublin City Centre and beyond. The N4, M50 and Liffey Valley Shopping Centre are also all within easy reach.\r\nBright and beautifully presented internal living accommodation spans to c.63 sqm, and comprises of private own door entrance, spacious lounge/dining area, new fully fitted kitchen, two well-proportioned bedrooms and a stylish main bathroom. The property has been renovated from top to bottom and is presented in immaculate condition throughout, allowing the successful purchaser to move straight in with nothing further to do.\r\nA standout feature of No. 38 is the stunning sunny rear garden which has been landscaped to create a wonderful private outdoor retreat, perfect for relaxing, or entertaining. The property further benefits from designated parking and excellent natural light throughout.\r\nThis is a rare opportunity to acquire a turnkey home in one of Dublin 10's most accessible residential locations. Combining stylish interiors, exceptional outdoor space and unrivalled transport links, No. 38 is sure to appeal to first time buyers, investors and those looking to downsize alike. Early viewing is strongly advised contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers today to arrange a viewing!\r\nAdditional Features;\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>c. 63 sqm</li>\r\n <li>BER C3</li>\r\n <li>2 Bed / 1 Bath</li>\r\n <li>Own door ground floor apartment</li>\r\n <li>Designated parking</li>\r\n <li>Electric heating</li>\r\n <li>Double glazed windows</li>\r\n <li>NEW Kitchen</li>\r\n <li>Sunny landscaped rear garden</li>\r\n <li>Renovated from top to bottom</li>\r\n <li>Bright and airy</li>\r\n <li>Well-proportioned layout throughout</li>\r\n <li>Plenty of transport links nearby</li>\r\n <li>Wide range of local amenities within walking distance</li>\r\n <li>Highly sought after location</li>\r\n <li>Ideal for first time buyers, downsizers, and investors</li>\r\n <li>Viewing highly advised!</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\nDirections;\r\nEircode: D10KK55"
      },
      {
